# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copied crate `crates/zim-search` (ex-kiwix, now a workspace member).
# The .gitignore shipped INSIDE the copied crate is not inherited by this repo,
# so the parent must cover the member's own artifacts explicitly here.
# (Nested Cargo.lock is ignored by cargo inside a workspace — only the
# workspace-root lock is consulted — but it is still ignored to keep the tree clean.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
crates/zim-search/target/
crates/zim-search/.fastembed_cache/
crates/zim-search/.indexes/
crates/zim-search/indices
crates/zim-search/indicies
crates/zim-search/kiwix_dir
crates/zim-search/Cargo.lock
crates/zim-search/*.idx.bin
